713	
714	To introduce the template components, we describe the GEMM kernel in detail in Appendix C.1.
715	
716	**Benchmarking approach** Our kernels in Section 4 are benchmarked on an NVIDIA H100 80GB SXM GPU with 10 warmup and 10 timed iterations using timings measured in C++. We also provide Python-bound kernels and benchmarking infrastructure in our repository for reference.
